	(gr_text "Group on User.Drawings is the amalgamation of\nall wedge fasteners that a solar module should\nencounter on a 1, 2, and 3U structure. Keep\ncomponents out of that as much as possible.\n\nC7 and J4 currently are the only visible issues,\nand should be OK.\n"
